"applications to be searched and displayed in the Dash underneath the "
"Applications header. If you do not wish to search this content source, you "
"can disable this search plugin."
msgstr ""
"Isto es un extension de recerca de Ubuntu que permitte le informationes del  "
"applicationes fluente, ser cercate e exponite in le Dash sub le titulo "
"Applicationes. Si tu non desira cercar in iste fontes de contento, tu pote "
"disactivar iste plugin de recerca."

#: ../data/runningapps.scope.in.in.h:3
msgid "Search running applications"
msgstr "Cercar le applicationes fluente"
